Dependencies: Context

Purpose:
  Define context dependency graph, invalidation rules, and
  context fingerprinting.

ContextDependencyGraph:
  Task → Domain → Module → Artifacts
  Task → Skills → Sections
  Task → Decisions → Implementation

ContextFingerprint:
  Format: CTX-XXXX
  Metadata: project, task, skills, docs, source, workflow

ContextInvalidation:
  Trigger:
    - Source code change
    - .sdd change
    - Architecture change
    - Skill update

  Process:
    SOURCE CHANGE
      ↓
    DEPENDENCY GRAPH
      ↓
    INVALIDATE
      ↓
    REBUILD CONTEXT

InvalidationScope:
  source.go changed:
    - module.sdd
    - related docs
    - related tests
    - dependent tasks

ContextAudit:
  Format: CTX-<ID>
  Loaded: tasks, layers, skills, tests
  Excluded: unrelated domains, unrelated infrastructure
  Note: Full prompt/history NOT stored (token/storage saving).

State: +